*{ALINK(pagename=>What's New?,aname=>3May2010)}3 May 2010{ALINK} The popular children's story book [The Berenstain Bears Get in a Fight|The Berenstain Bears Get in a Fight] has been translated into Lojban.  It can be listened to as well as read. {ALINK(pagename=>What's New?,aname=>3May2010)}  More... {ALINK}
*{ALINK(pagename=>What's New?,aname=>4Apr2010)}4 April 2010{ALINK} The Lojban community's annual convention, [jbonunsla|Logfest] (known in Lojban as [jbonunsla|jbonunsla]), will be held during April 30 - May 2 this year at    [http://www.penguicon.org/|Penguicon 2010] in Troy, Michigan in the USA. {ALINK(pagename=>What's New?,aname=>4Apr2010)}  More... {ALINK}
*{ALINK(pagename=>What's New?,aname=>23Mar2010)}23 March 2010{ALINK} The first stage of implementing Lojban vocabulary on [http://smart.fm/|Smart.fm], a new adaptive flashcard learning tool, has been completed. {ALINK(pagename=>What's New?,aname=>23Mar2010)}  More... {ALINK}

